{"q":"767","t":"Reorganize String","d":"Medium","p":false,"c":"<p>Given a string <code>s</code>, rearrange the characters of <code>s</code> so that any two adjacent characters are not the same.</p>\n\n<p>Return <em>any possible rearrangement of</em> <code>s</code> <em>or return</em> <code>&quot;&quot;</code> <em>if not possible</em>.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 1:</strong></p>\n<pre><strong>Input:</strong> s = \"aab\"\n<strong>Output:</strong> \"aba\"\n</pre><p><strong class=\"example\">Example 2:</strong></p>\n<pre><strong>Input:</strong> s = \"aaab\"\n<strong>Output:</strong> \"\"\n</pre>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Constraints:</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><code>1 &lt;= s.length &lt;= 500</code></li>\n\t<li><code>s</code> consists of lowercase English letters.</li>\n</ul>\n","h":["Alternate placing the most common letters."],"m":"{\n  \"name\": \"reorganizeString\",\n  \"params\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"s\",\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"return\": {\n    \"type\": \"string\"\n  }\n}","g":[{"name":"Hash Table","slug":"hash-table"},{"name":"String","slug":"string"},{"name":"Greedy","slug":"greedy"},{"name":"Sorting","slug":"sorting"},{"name":"Heap (Priority Queue)","slug":"heap-priority-queue"},{"name":"Counting","slug":"counting"}],"s":[{"t":"Rearrange String k Distance Apart","s":"rearrange-string-k-distance-apart","d":"Hard","p":false},{"t":"Task Scheduler","s":"task-scheduler","d":"Medium","p":false},{"t":"Longest Happy String","s":"longest-happy-string","d":"Medium","p":false}],"co":[["Amazon","amazon"],["Google","google"],["DE Shaw","de-shaw"],["Tesla","tesla"],["Bloomberg","bloomberg"],["Microsoft","microsoft"],["Oracle","oracle"],["Roblox","roblox"],["Audible","audible"],["Expedia","expedia"],["Meta","facebook"],["TikTok","tiktok"],["Goldman Sachs","goldman-sachs"],["Pinterest","pinterest"],["IBM","ibm"],["Zoho","zoho"]],"cs":{"a":[["Amazon","amazon",19],["DE Shaw","de-shaw",3]],"b":[["Google","google",5],["